                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a7ee5f0c-35eb-4a7e-a84b-d0f99cf338eb",
                        "entry_id": "52761b57-2731-3240-9fad-8e14b6c1bd87",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "о́хавши"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "86e2db2c-193f-4b29-8c70-7f6098982423",
                        "entry_id": "52761b57-2731-3240-9fad-8e14b6c1bd87",
                        "tags": [
                            "future"
                        ],
                        "form": "буду/будешь… о́хать"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a80493d0-b69c-3942-92a5-5ef1329e971e",
                        "entry_id": "52761b57-2731-3240-9fad-8e14b6c1bd87",
                        "glosses": [
                            "часто повторять восклицание ох!"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3850af-4ad6-46c7-8a45-b0c9b0127019",
                                "sense_id": "a80493d0-b69c-3942-92a5-5ef1329e971e",
                                "text": "Когда я поддерживал Нину, она стояла довольно уверенно, но стоило только отпустить её руку, как Нина начинала визжать, охать, размахивать руками и катилась прямиком к ближайшему сугробу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32b6f7b3-dba5-4b03-936c-0095612bddf3",
                                "sense_id": "a80493d0-b69c-3942-92a5-5ef1329e971e",
                                "text": "Ревматизм от сильного движения разыгрался: учитель повалился на постель и начал первоначально охать, потом стонать и, наконец, заплакал."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "01918f94-fc4b-3e62-b163-8b3be5570c11",
                        "entry_id": "52761b57-2731-3240-9fad-8e14b6c1bd87",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. пассивно выражать неудовольствие чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e420e855-eedd-46d2-8490-cbf8bb76b65a",
                                "sense_id": "01918f94-fc4b-3e62-b163-8b3be5570c11",
                                "text": "Не нужно усиленно охать по поводу нашей «отсталости», а искать путей к тому, чтобы превзойти постановку радиовещания в буржуазных странах."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "165725fd-f10e-45ce-b561-80f90f76fca0",
                        "source_entry_id": "52761b57-2731-3240-9fad-8e14b6c1bd87",
                        "target_lang_word": "sigh",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sigh",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6bafcbd-39ba-388b-b429-2e62115fa9f4",
                                        "entry_id": "34ce3a18-ff35-30b2-8ec5-f028fb835cc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A deep, prolonged audible inhale and exhale of breath; as when fatigued, frustrated, grieved, or relieved; the act of sighing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74be4638-6fb0-4585-bee9-819cd37966fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b6bafcbd-39ba-388b-b429-2e62115fa9f4",
                                                "text": "To Pollyanna the air was all the more stifling after that cool breath of the out of doors; but she did not complain. She only drew a long quivering sigh."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9325825b-40ff-3240-898d-79a892c76f8a",
                                        "entry_id": "34ce3a18-ff35-30b2-8ec5-f028fb835cc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a manifestation of grief; a lament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "872553a7-4766-311d-b98b-5817a1e12b13",
                                        "entry_id": "34ce3a18-ff35-30b2-8ec5-f028fb835cc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is bored."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Cockney",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sigh",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e488e808-7992-3a77-a2db-d0a2ba61ae9b",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inhale a larger quantity of air than usual, and immediately expel it; to make a deep single audible respiration, especially as the result or involuntary expression of fatigue, exhaustion, grief, sorrow, frustration, or the like."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ab9d34-d362-4307-953a-88b4adb12d81",
                                                "sense_id": "e488e808-7992-3a77-a2db-d0a2ba61ae9b",
                                                "text": "When she saw it wasn't damaged, she sighed with relief."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "348e37b5-3bb9-4797-9dd4-fb4f2429a921",
                                                "sense_id": "e488e808-7992-3a77-a2db-d0a2ba61ae9b",
                                                "text": "He sighed. It was going to be a long night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9f90cbd-ceb8-495e-b2e7-4d57e1294b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "e488e808-7992-3a77-a2db-d0a2ba61ae9b",
                                                "text": "He sighed over the lost opportunity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd5190ec-c0a1-493f-aef0-2131247e3409",
                                                "sense_id": "e488e808-7992-3a77-a2db-d0a2ba61ae9b",
                                                "text": "A waiter brought his aperitif, which was a small scotch and soda, and as he sipped it gratefully he sighed.\n ‘Civilized,’ he said to Mr. Campion. ‘Humanizing.’ […] ‘Cigars and summer days and women in big hats with swansdown face-powder, that's what it reminds me of.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2016f98-1887-3f4a-9c56-926ced727e61",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lament; to grieve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0872647-4848-4c82-bba7-076ed683bb8d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2016f98-1887-3f4a-9c56-926ced727e61",
                                                "text": "He sighed deeply in his spirit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6573d505-0779-33c7-81cf-1d67db49debc",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter sighs over; to lament or mourn over."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22911ff0-986e-4ea7-9181-1de9207a8089",
                                                "sense_id": "6573d505-0779-33c7-81cf-1d67db49debc",
                                                "text": "Ages to come, and men unborn, / Shall bless her name, and sigh her fate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54d4bd9b-f5a5-4a15-9176-17f16d4c0ae9",
                                                "sense_id": "6573d505-0779-33c7-81cf-1d67db49debc",
                                                "text": "The lassie had grace given her to refuse, but with a woeful heart, and Heriotside rode off in black discontent, leaving poor Ailie to sigh her love. He came back the next day and the next, but aye he got the same answer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ac6851e-e620-3da4-ae03-cd8985d6b423",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a sound like sighing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bff168a3-f3e5-4f56-a234-0e8456713d68",
                                                "sense_id": "0ac6851e-e620-3da4-ae03-cd8985d6b423",
                                                "text": "And the coming wind did roar more loud, / And the sails did sigh like sedge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8d33072-0201-4392-bfbd-7c0d5ad4809c",
                                                "sense_id": "0ac6851e-e620-3da4-ae03-cd8985d6b423",
                                                "text": "The winter winds are wearily sighing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9730cd2c-9ce2-37b9-a032-fdc4f6572925",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exhale (the breath) in sighs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "015fc149-5c2d-4875-a60d-44294e1f81c5",
                                                "sense_id": "9730cd2c-9ce2-37b9-a032-fdc4f6572925",
                                                "text": "She sighed a sigh that was nearly a groan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ba70d3b-8f87-43a2-bf7e-33270f12687f",
                                                "sense_id": "9730cd2c-9ce2-37b9-a032-fdc4f6572925",
                                                "text": "sigh a note and sing a note"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cca7b0de-cbc9-4a2d-9002-7bae4b6f82c6",
                                                "sense_id": "9730cd2c-9ce2-37b9-a032-fdc4f6572925",
                                                "text": "Never man sighed truer breath."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1fe11d7-642c-3ed0-9dde-f28aeeca3e22",
                                        "entry_id": "9aeb2238-c3c3-3516-b0e2-316cf867f5b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express by sighs; to utter in or with sighs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4c1bccc-1ce6-4307-9f41-ae5db2ce4254",
                                                "sense_id": "b1fe11d7-642c-3ed0-9dde-f28aeeca3e22",
                                                "text": "\"I guess I have no choice,\" she sighed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1efc909-8493-4c67-96d1-abe6332873d3",
                                                "sense_id": "b1fe11d7-642c-3ed0-9dde-f28aeeca3e22",
                                                "text": "She sighed her frustrations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0851a674-dfe6-49e6-89b3-1af30fd08f48",
                                                "sense_id": "b1fe11d7-642c-3ed0-9dde-f28aeeca3e22",
                                                "text": "They […] sighed forth proverbs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "777bd283-deef-4060-bd5b-d41fb5eb17a9",
                                                "sense_id": "b1fe11d7-642c-3ed0-9dde-f28aeeca3e22",
                                                "text": "The gentle swain […] sighs back her grief."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sigh",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91dc5151-7c13-37b7-8c8f-1de0a4998ce8",
                                        "entry_id": "ec5961de-6632-3f93-a6a2-21ef80b73e77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of fatigue, exhaustion, grief, sorrow, frustration, or the like, often used in casual written contexts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "429420dc-251f-4997-8550-43bc5204ffae",
                                                "sense_id": "91dc5151-7c13-37b7-8c8f-1de0a4998ce8",
                                                "text": "Sigh, I'm so bored at work today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
